WEBVTT

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:18.580
"First year"
"Hitotsuyanagi Riri"

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:21.580
It's morning!

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:24.370
My first morning at the academy!

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:25.660
How do you do?

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:27.540
Oh! Did I wake you?

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:30.250
I'm so sorry!

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:34.160
This is my roommate, Ito Shizu.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:37.040
She's a natural-born leader raised
to stand above others... apparently.

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:39.540
"First year"
"Ito Shizu"

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:39.540
She's a natural-born leader raised
to stand above others... apparently.

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:40.950
"First year"
"Ito Shizu"

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:46.250
Did you sleep hugging your CHARM all night?

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:47.830
Huh? Yeah.

00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:52.870
They told me to keep it with me
at all times when they issued it to me.

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:58.410
Plus, CHARMs are kind of warm,
so it came in handy at night in Koshu.

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:00.000
What a weirdo.

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:18.790
"Assault Lily
BOUQUET"

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:35.620
Well, I'll head out now.

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:37.370
Oh, okay.

00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:40.330
Umm, uh...

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:44.250
I'll help.

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:45.870
Face away from me.

00:02:45.870 --> 00:02:48.290
Th-Thanks.

00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:57.160
Does your injury from yesterday hurt?

00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:01.290
No, it's fine.

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:04.620
I see. You were lucky.

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:13.950
"Episode 2"

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:25.040
Oh, morning, Riri.

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:28.000
"Alfheim first year"
"Endo Araya"

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:31.580
Oh, hi.

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:34.370
I mean, how do you do?

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:36.870
Don't stand on ceremony.

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:39.290
How about a more substantial hello?

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:41.160
"Substantial"?

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:48.500
You there!

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:49.160
Get away from my Riri!

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:51.120
"First year"
"Kaede Johan Nouvel"

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:51.120
Get away from my Riri!

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:51.370
Get away from my Riri!

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:53.000
You again?

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.370
I thought you were after Miss Yuyu.

00:03:55.370 --> 00:03:57.370
I guess you'll go for anyone.

00:03:57.370 --> 00:03:59.620
We had a fateful encounter.

00:03:59.620 --> 00:04:02.750
It was so dramatic that even I could not resist.

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:04.410
Oh, yeah?

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:08.410
Well, the "girl of your destiny"
doesn't seem so convinced.

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:11.500
Show some resistance, too, Riri!

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:14.500
Are all Lilies like this?

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:18.620
If you really are destined to be with Riri,

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:21.330
you'd better tie her down tight,

00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:23.540
or I'll gobble her up.

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:24.950
You needn't worry.

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:28.580
The bond between Riri
and I is not so fragile that...

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:31.790
Oh my, Riri?

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:33.790
Riri?!

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:35.370
"Gardenia House"

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:41.200
I have to thank Miss Yuyu for yesterday!

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:45.580
Good morning, Miss Yuyu!

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:48.910
"Second Year"
"Shirai Yuyu"

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:50.540
Huh?

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:53.500
Umm, Miss Yuyu?

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:55.330
Excuse me, Miss Yuyu!

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:57.750
It's me, Riri.

00:04:57.750 --> 00:05:02.500
I wanted to thank you for yesterday, and...

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:14.120
H-How do you do?!

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:21.790
Oh.

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:23.040
Riri!

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:23.500
"First year"
"Futagawa Fumi"

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:23.500
Riri!

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:25.540
"First year"
"Futagawa Fumi"

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:25.540
Oh, Fumi!

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:26.700
Oh, Fumi!

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:27.040
--Ho--

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:28.500
--Ho--
--Ho--

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:30.330
How do you do?

00:05:31.540 --> 00:05:34.950
It just hit me that I'm really at Yurigaoka!

00:05:34.950 --> 00:05:36.370
Me, too!

00:05:36.370 --> 00:05:40.080
And we're in the same class!

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:41.370
Really?

00:05:41.370 --> 00:05:42.660
Thank goodness.

00:05:42.660 --> 00:05:43.790
I'm so glad!

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:47.410
It makes me happy to see you so delighted.

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:48.910
Oh, Kaede!

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:50.660
"Hara Midori"     "Yamada Samidori"
"Kaede J. Nouvel"     "Hitotsuyanagi Riri"

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:52.290
It's true.

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:54.620
You and I are side by side.

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:58.250
This is Magie guiding us together!

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:00.750
Isn't it in alphabetical order?

00:06:01.910 --> 00:06:04.830
Wow, what a view!

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:07.620
We even get footbaths.

00:06:07.620 --> 00:06:10.040
Is it really okay to soak in them this early?

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:12.700
Lectures start tomorrow.

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:15.500
I hear it's the director's policy.

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:19.080
The academy is on the front
lines of Huge interception,

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:22.410
but it's also meant to be
a place of sanctuary for Lilies.

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:23.620
"Sanctuary"?

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:25.660
Like holy ground.

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:30.580
A heaven where we aren't
ruled or threatened by anyone.

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:31.950
"Heaven"?

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:39.410
I suppose it's the adults' way of
atoning for relying on little girls like us.

00:06:39.410 --> 00:06:41.330
But it's strange.

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:45.000
Newbies like Riri and me are in the same class

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:47.910
as experienced Lilies like you, Ms. Nouvel.

00:06:47.910 --> 00:06:51.750
So many different experience and skill levels.

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:53.620
You've done your homework.

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:57.540
Please, call me Kaede.

00:06:57.540 --> 00:06:58.700
You mean it?

00:06:58.700 --> 00:06:59.660
Wow!

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:03.540
I can't believe I get to get so close
to the head of Grand Guignol's daughter!

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:06.620
Think nothing of it.

00:07:06.620 --> 00:07:09.250
What's Gui... Guigno-guigno?

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:10.580
You mean you don't know?!

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:13.370
But I already explained it to you!

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:22.330
Grand Guignol is based in France. It's one of
the world's top CHARM manufacturers, Riri!

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:24.500
No, it's <i>the </i>top manufacturer!

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:27.910
Father makes the best CHARMs in the world.

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:30.080
Just say the word, Riri,

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:36.660
and I'll order you a finely tuned,
custom-made CHARM of the finest quality.

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:38.580
I hope you like it!

00:07:42.450 --> 00:07:43.410
Riri,

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:46.200
where did you go after breakfast?

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:49.160
Oh, I stopped by the old building.

00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:50.120
I see.

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:52.870
You went to say hello to Miss Yuyu, right?

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:56.910
I'd like Miss Yuyu to be my Schutzengel, so...

00:07:56.910 --> 00:08:02.160
Oh, but normally the older student
is the one to ask about that.

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:03.870
But Kaede, yesterday you--

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:06.040
I'm not bound by the past.

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:09.000
At Yurigaoka Girls' Academy,

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:15.830
"Schutzengel" means a pledge of sisterhood
between an older and younger student.

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:19.250
The older girl acts as
a Schutzengel, or guardian angel,

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:22.660
and guides the younger girl, her Schild.

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:26.250
But Miss Yuyu wouldn't even look me in the eye.

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:29.660
What? But you seemed to get along yesterday.

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:32.660
I wonder if she hates me.

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:36.870
Well, she is known for being moody.

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:41.950
Forget Schutzengel pledges;
Miss Yuyu isn't even in a legion right now.

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:45.790
I hear she always fights the Huge alone.

00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:48.160
Kaede!

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:51.080
Would you teach me how to use my CHARM?

00:08:51.080 --> 00:08:52.540
I'd be delighted.

00:08:52.540 --> 00:08:54.370
--But training starts tomor--

00:08:54.370 --> 00:08:55.330
--Silence, shrimp!
--But training starts tomor--

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:56.830
--Silence, shrimp!
--"Shrimp"?!

00:08:58.080 --> 00:09:02.750
I want to become a full-fledged Lily
as soon as possible.

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:04.830
That way...

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:08.950
I understand how you feel,
but you mustn't rush...

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:12.450
...is what I would normally say,

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:15.580
but this is the front line against the Huge.

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:18.580
We have a mix of beginners and veteran Lilies

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:23.040
because we're expected to help
each other improve on our own.

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:24.660
Then...

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:28.500
I would be happy to help you.

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:29.580
Meaning?

00:09:29.580 --> 00:09:33.120
I'll thoroughly, legally...

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:35.660
Hey, look what you made me say!

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:47.910
Let's go, Kusumi.

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:50.200
All right, Soraha.

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:21.200
Second-year Amano Soraha
and first-year Egawa Kusumi!

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:23.790
Those two made a Schutzengel pledge, too.

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:25.000
What, already?!

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:25.160
"Alfheim second year"      "Alfheim first year"
"Amano Soraha"            "Egawa Kusumi"

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:29.290
"Alfheim second year"      "Alfheim first year"
"Amano Soraha"            "Egawa Kusumi"

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:29.290
They've known each other since junior high.

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:32.790
Come on, Riri, draw your CHARM, too.

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:34.120
Oh, yeah.

00:10:34.120 --> 00:10:35.910
Umm...

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:38.120
Like this.

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:49.290
An Yggdrasil Gungnir.

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:51.580
A good CHARM for beginners.

00:10:58.120 --> 00:11:00.080
Lighter than a bird's feathers,

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:02.250
sharper than a bee's stinger,

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:05.000
and sometimes heavier and harder than steel.

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:07.540
This is a CHARM.

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:10.000
That ostentation is Grand Guignol all over.

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:11.870
"Ostentation"?

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:14.500
Training on your own? I'm impressed.

00:11:14.500 --> 00:11:16.410
What brings you here, Miriam?

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:16.540
"First year"
"Miriam Hildegard von Gropius"

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:18.080
"First year"
"Miriam Hildegard von Gropius"

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:18.080
CHARM tune-ups.

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:20.370
"First year"
"Miriam Hildegard von Gropius"

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:20.370
I come every day since I arrived.

00:11:20.370 --> 00:11:22.250
You can tune up CHARMs?

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:23.500
Naturally.

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:25.580
I'm in the arsenal division.

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:28.000
She's in Arsenal Division and also a Lily!

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:32.040
That's Miriam Hildegard von Gropius, Riri!

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:33.370
Fumi, you're bleeding!

00:11:33.370 --> 00:11:34.750
Are you well?

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:36.330
Yes, don't worry!

00:11:36.330 --> 00:11:38.910
It's been happening since yesterday!

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:42.830
You've got some Magie stored up.

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:44.700
You seem fairly frank.

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:46.500
You can tell?

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:51.330
CHARMs learn their owner's Magie
through always being at their side.

00:11:51.330 --> 00:11:55.700
So, a Lily's CHARM becomes a part of her body.

00:11:55.700 --> 00:11:56.580
--Wow.

00:11:56.580 --> 00:11:59.660
I wonder if we'll be like that one day, too.

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:00.580
Hmm...

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:03.500
Still, the fact that you got into Yurigaoka

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:08.000
means there must be something
exceptional about you.

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:10.330
I hope so.

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:13.830
I'm positive Kaede feels the same way.

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:18.000
She's holding her peace because...

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:22.160
...unconfident people are easier to manipulate.

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:24.580
"Kaede is surprisingly unscrupulous."

00:12:24.580 --> 00:12:27.580
Hey! You take that back!

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:29.790
If you want to learn about CHARMs,

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:32.330
why not stop by Arsenal Division?

00:12:32.330 --> 00:12:35.500
Miss Moyu will tell you all about them.

00:12:39.910 --> 00:12:41.790
Well?

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:43.620
Yes, it's fine.

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:47.750
It was a touch shaky,
so I changed out several parts.

00:12:47.750 --> 00:12:50.870
Replace the barrel after two more sorties.

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:53.830
Don't forget; I almost always do.

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:55.370
You're welcome.

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:56.290
Yes.

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:57.870
Thank you.

00:13:00.080 --> 00:13:00.250
Honestly, she's so unendearing.

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:03.700
"Arsenal Division second year"
"Mashima Moyu"

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:03.700
Honestly, she's so unendearing.

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:10.330
This is Arsenal Division.

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:15.700
There are all these facilities underground?

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:18.790
Are you in, Miss Moyu?

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:19.870
So bright!

00:13:19.870 --> 00:13:21.200
How do you do?

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:22.450
Hang on.

00:13:22.450 --> 00:13:26.120
I'm just about to temper a CHARM blade.

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:36.370
Welcome.

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:38.290
Riri and Kaede, right?

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:40.410
And you're...

00:13:40.410 --> 00:13:42.790
Fumi! Futagawa Fumi!

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:44.370
Nice to meet you, Fumi.

00:13:44.370 --> 00:13:46.790
You came at a great time.

00:13:46.790 --> 00:13:50.120
Come on, turn out right.

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:04.450
I've been working on that for a month!

00:14:08.830 --> 00:14:11.250
What is it?

00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:16.160
CHARMs have spells for controlling
Magie engraved on their blades.

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:20.870
These spells activate the Magie
that flows from a Lily's body

00:14:20.870 --> 00:14:24.410
and cleave through the
Magie that supports a Huge.

00:14:24.410 --> 00:14:27.250
A Huge's Magie...

00:14:27.250 --> 00:14:30.200
Magie is what gives Lilies our power,

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:33.450
but it's also what empowers the Huge.

00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:34.700
Well, it stands to reason.

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:36.330
I assume you know that?

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:38.620
Yes, I learned about it.

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:40.290
We've got these, too.

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:41.250
Here.

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:42.700
Huh?

00:14:44.540 --> 00:14:47.540
A CHARM gun barrel. Look closely.

00:14:47.540 --> 00:14:50.410
It's got spells etched into the rifling.

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:56.160
When a bullet travels through,
its marked with a spell as well as with Magie.

00:14:56.160 --> 00:15:03.540
Unlike the Huge, Lilies rely
on CHARMs to control Magie, but...

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:06.540
Oh, I screwed up again.

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:12.910
Still, a Schutzengel pledge
with Yuyu of all people.

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:13.830
Yes.

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:16.790
But she won't even give me the time of day.

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:18.250
Umm...

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:20.790
What CHARM does Miss Yuyu use now?

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:22.370
A Brionac.

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:24.500
And two years ago?

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:26.500
A Dáinsleif.

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:32.870
Why did Miss Yuyu switch CHARMs?

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:34.250
I see.

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:36.910
You'd have to ask her about that.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:39.790
Do you know anything about it, Miss Moyu?

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:42.290
I do, but I won't tell you.

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:44.160
Why not?

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:49.080
I can't go around chatting about things
she wouldn't want me to, now can I?

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:50.910
Oh.

00:15:50.910 --> 00:15:55.080
Lilies are public entities,
and tax money is invested in them,

00:15:55.080 --> 00:16:00.950
but their personal info is private for
a fixed period unless they wish otherwise.

00:16:00.950 --> 00:16:04.330
Psychological states directly
impact combat effectiveness,

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:09.000
so it probably has to be this way
with sensitive teenage girls.

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:12.700
Miss Yuyu doesn't seem very sensitive to me.

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:14.410
She's <i>too </i>sensitive.

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:17.910
So sensitive she withdrew from--

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:19.620
Oops, I said too much.

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:21.250
Ask her for the rest.

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:23.200
If she'll tell you.

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:24.160
Okay.

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:28.870
Why are you so fixated on Miss Yuyu, Riri?

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:34.950
It's like she's a different person
from when I first met her.

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:39.500
I don't understand it, and I want to know why.

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:42.580
Even if Miss Yuyu doesn't want you to?

00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:45.660
Or do you think you can change her?

00:16:45.660 --> 00:16:49.080
Isn't that just your ego talking?

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:50.290
You...

00:16:50.290 --> 00:16:53.290
...might be right, but...

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:04.580
What changed Miss Yuyu?

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:04.870
"Second year"
"Yoshimura Thi Mai"

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:04.870
What changed Miss Yuyu?

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:07.040
"Second year"
"Yoshimura Thi Mai"

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:07.040
What is she carrying locked up in her heart?

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:08.910
What is she carrying locked up in her heart?

00:17:08.910 --> 00:17:12.330
I want to know the answer.

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:20.620
I suppose you'll just have to risk it.

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:25.330
Once Miss Yuyu chews Riri out
and leaves her like a worn-out rag,

00:17:25.330 --> 00:17:27.370
I'll reach out a helping hand,

00:17:27.370 --> 00:17:30.700
and that will be that!

00:17:30.700 --> 00:17:34.040
Kaede, you said all that out loud.

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:51.250
W-Wait!

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:53.540
Miss Yuyu!

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:57.040
Please make a Schutzengel pledge with me!

00:17:59.250 --> 00:18:02.660
You saved me,

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:05.790
and I became a Lily because I admire you.

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:12.080
You're free to admire whomever you like,

00:18:12.080 --> 00:18:16.700
but that has nothing to do
with you becoming my Schild.

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:18.330
Well...

00:18:18.330 --> 00:18:24.700
Making a Schutzengel pledge with you
would only lower my tactical capabilities.

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:27.000
Is that what you want?

00:18:35.120 --> 00:18:38.080
Stop, Kaede!

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:40.910
She blocked me again?

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:52.620
That's not what a Schutzengel
pledge is supposed to be!

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:57.200
It's about communicating mutual love
and care across generations.

00:18:57.200 --> 00:19:01.160
I've heard it's not something
you do for short-term gain.

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:02.750
Am I wrong?!

00:19:02.750 --> 00:19:08.830
A fool like you actually
needs a pure girl like Riri!

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:17.500
I see. I understand.

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:19.250
What do you mean?

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:21.370
I accept your proposal.

00:19:21.370 --> 00:19:23.290
What?

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:25.750
I will agree

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:29.580
to be Riri's guardian angel--her Schutzengel.

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:32.200
Miss Yuyu...

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:35.790
I feel a little refreshed. Thank you.

00:19:35.790 --> 00:19:38.580
You're nicer than I thought, Kaede.

00:19:38.580 --> 00:19:40.200
I was wrong about you.

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:44.660
Oh, what have I done?!

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:46.250
--You're lovely and cool. That's our Kaede.

00:19:46.250 --> 00:19:47.540
--Riri.
--You're lovely and cool. That's our Kaede.

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:49.500
---Y-Yes?
--You're lovely and cool. That's our Kaede.

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:52.200
Don't regret this.

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:55.330
Right! I know I won't!

00:19:58.410 --> 00:20:00.790
"Rooftop Garden"
"18:00: third years"
"19:00: second years"
"20:00: first years"

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:08.580
Is anywhere giving you a hard time?

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:11.290
Wherever it is, I'll wash it for you.

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:14.330
It's been bothering me:

00:20:14.330 --> 00:20:17.290
the way you look at Riri
is kind of sinister, Kaede.

00:20:17.290 --> 00:20:20.500
Nonsense! My gaze is pure as the driven snow!

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:25.910
Are you sure you won't pretend your hand
slipped and touch her in weird places?

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:27.330
Interfering little...

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:30.040
There are no "weird places" on Riri's body.

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:31.790
Anywhere is fine.

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:33.120
That's right, Fumi.

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:34.580
I mean, we are both girls.

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:36.450
What, you don't mind?!

00:20:36.450 --> 00:20:38.330
I'm definitely concerned.

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:42.540
This is my just reward for helping Riri.

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:43.700
What are you, a dog?

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:44.790
What did you call me?!

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:48.160
Listen, Riri, there are all
sorts of people in the world.

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:52.040
It goes without saying that all
orientations should be accepted,

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:56.120
but you ought to keep your lusts under control.

00:20:56.120 --> 00:21:00.040
That's what that shrimp was trying to say.

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:02.950
"First year"     "First Year"     "First year"
"Ando Tazusa"  "Wang Yujia"  "Kuo Shenlin"

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:02.950
--A shrimp just called me a shrimp!

00:21:02.950 --> 00:21:04.410
"First year"     "First Year"     "First year"
"Ando Tazusa"  "Wang Yujia"  "Kuo Shenlin"

00:21:02.950 --> 00:21:04.410
--A shrimp just called me a shrimp!
--Curse you, pipsqueaks!

00:21:04.410 --> 00:21:05.790
"First year"     "First Year"     "First year"
"Ando Tazusa"  "Wang Yujia"  "Kuo Shenlin"

00:21:04.410 --> 00:21:05.790
What a racket.

00:21:05.790 --> 00:21:06.410
What a racket.

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:11.450
Welcome back.

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:14.200
Huh? Oh, uh, I'm home.

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:18.080
Did you have a nice day?

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:19.870
Yup!

00:21:19.870 --> 00:21:26.330
I became a Lily and got into
Yurigaoka, and everyone is so nice.

00:21:26.330 --> 00:21:28.290
It's like a dream come true.

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:30.750
Seriously?

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:32.580
It's only your second day.

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:34.330
Yeah.

00:21:34.330 --> 00:21:37.540
I'm just so glad.

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:49.410
Are you punishing yourself?

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:55.950
Oh, but you made the first move,
so I suppose it's a net zero.

00:21:55.950 --> 00:21:59.500
Be that as it may, congratulations, Yuyu.

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:03.500
I can't believe you made a
Schutzengel pledge with an underclassman.

00:22:03.500 --> 00:22:05.080
I'm touched.

00:22:05.080 --> 00:22:07.870
It isn't something I wanted.

00:22:09.120 --> 00:22:12.200
But you did open your heart, didn't you?

00:22:12.200 --> 00:22:13.700
That's...

00:22:13.700 --> 00:22:16.540
...because she won't understand otherwise.

00:22:16.540 --> 00:22:18.120
How scary.

00:22:18.120 --> 00:22:21.790
I see you're heartless, too.

00:22:21.790 --> 00:22:23.200
Yes.

00:22:23.200 --> 00:22:25.290
I'm a cruel woman.

00:22:28.080 --> 00:22:31.250
A Schutzengel pledge with me?

00:22:31.250 --> 00:22:33.450
I hope she regrets it.

